config RT_USING_BL616_NETHUB
    bool "LEAKCAM: BL616 NetHub Wi-Fi over SDIO"
    depends on RT_USING_WIFI && RT_USING_SDIO0
    default n
    help
        Station Wi-Fi through a BL616 running Bouffalo's NetHub bridge on SDIO0
        (SDIO id 424c:0606). The BL616 bridges Ethernet frames; lwIP on this side
        runs DHCP and all sockets. It does not select BSP_USING_WIFI_SDIO: the
        board's boot-time Wi-Fi probe would search for a card that the BL616
        starts only on request. MMC0 is probed only through /dev/bl616.
